    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Self‑attested RC Photocopy</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A clear, photocopied copy of the vehicle’s Registration Certificate (RC) must be self‑attested by the bike’s owner. This proves ownership and is mandatory for all carriers and customs authorities.</p>
