    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Valid Insurance Certificate</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A copy of the bike’s existing insurance policy, showing coverage for the entire duration of the transit. This protects against accidental damage or theft during handling and transport.</p>
