    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Final securing and documentation:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Anchor the bike on the transport pallet using anti‑slip mats and ratchet straps, double‑check strap tension, and attach the audit report, battery log, fuel level note, and FASTag receipt to the shipment manifest. This comprehensive packet gives peace of mind whether you are using local services or national networks like Classic Packers and Movers Delhi.</p>
